# 🚀 Day 27 – Prior Authorization Story Simulator

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 27 focused on building an **Interactive Prior Authorization Story Simulator** using Claude AI. Instead of a traditional workflow dashboard, this project presents the Prior Authorization (PA) process through an engaging, story-driven experience that helps users understand complex healthcare insurance workflows.

---

# 🏥 Project Description

**Prior Authorization Story Simulator**

An interactive educational web application that follows **Rahul**, a patient diagnosed with Rheumatoid Arthritis, as he navigates the Prior Authorization process with guidance from **Priya**, a Healthcare Operations Specialist.

The simulator combines storytelling, decision-making, and healthcare education to make insurance workflows easy to understand.

---

# 🎯 Key Features

✅ Interactive Story-Based Learning

✅ 8 Story Chapters

✅ Rahul's Healthcare Journey

✅ Priya's Step-by-Step Explanations

✅ Two Interactive Choices After Every Scene

✅ Progress Tracker

✅ Educational Healthcare Insights

✅ Prior Authorization Workflow

✅ Approval, Denial & Appeal Scenarios

✅ Responsive Modern UI

✅ Restart Story Functionality

